poldek test suite

BuildRequires: check-devel
Reqires: fakeroot, python3 (for sh/lib/tndb-set-vlen), root or unshare -Urm (for the rpm tests)

To run all tests:

$ make check    # runs all C-based tests
$ make check-sh # runs tests written in shell (sh/ subdir)
$ make check-sh CHECK_SH_JOBS=4 # the same, 4 runs at a time

sh/ test scripts may be executed separately:

$ ./sh/07-depsolver -h

Particular tests may be choosen:

$ ./sh/07-depsolver -v -t testSuggests

Notes:
*) make check-sh keeps the files of each run in a directory of its own,
   /tmp/poldek-sh-tests.XXXXXX/<script>[.<compression>][.<install mode>] ($TMP
   or $TMPDIR in place of /tmp when set), and removes them when every run passes
*) set CK_FORK=no to run C-based test without fork